      "id": 482913,
      "username": "Peer",
      "name": "Peer",
      "created_at": "2025-10-02T09:24:15.199Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Type “POS” in the search field (awesomebar), then you should find “Open Point Of Sale” to click on, which opens the “Point of Sale” window.</p>\n<p>That’s probably an underdocumented feature.</p>\n<p>You can put a “Shortcut Link” on a custom “Workspace” which links to a “Page” which has the name “point-of-sale”, and name it as you like on your Workspace.</p>",
